Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:15.18,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:15.18,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 莱巴金娜 · 赛后亚军致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:02.88,EN,,0,0,0,,It's tough to find words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:02.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,一时不知道该说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,The tank was half empty today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天油箱只剩一半
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I tried my best but it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我尽力了但还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh just congratulate EGA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺伊加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and her team with a great tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,和她的团队 这一站打得很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh of course guys, thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然 谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,so much for incredible atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这么棒的氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It it was an amazing tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一届了不起的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:20.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm really hope I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:24.36,EN,,0,0,0,,can come back very soon here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,能很快再回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I also would like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我还想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to say thank you to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:34.08,EN,,0,0,0,,who made this tournament possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:34.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这届赛事得以举办的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Tournament director, all the sponsors,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛事总监 所有赞助商
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Rogers, National Bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,罗渣士 国家银行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and of course all the volunteers this couple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然还有这几周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:44.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of weeks and uh B kids sharers, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有志愿者 球童 每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,And last uh of course thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 当然要谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to my team guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Without you it won't be impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to get to the final and just hope
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不可能打进决赛 也希望
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that we can keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们能继续走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And of course thank you to the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然也要谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,of the team who is not there here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,团队里没能到场的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh I see you guys very soon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,很快就能见到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully we can carry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望我们能延续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:09.12,EN,,0,0,0,,on the good things
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:09.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些好的势头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh yeah just uh keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,继续走下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and go deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,走得更远
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:15.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.44,0:01:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
